	)
	(text "Per VCA Manufacturer’s spec, 6mV per dB attenuation\nfor max 0.78V, 0.78/0.006 = 130dB range\n130dB / 256 steps = 0.51dB / step\n\n178k offset resistor shifts output up by approx. 30dB\ncontrol range becomes -100dB to +30dB"
